  "summary_en": "US Executive Order 14110 (Oct 2023) sets eight principles and directs agencies to develop AI safety standards, require reporting from dual-use foundation model developers, protect workers, civil rights, consumers and privacy, and govern federal AI use. Embodied content is minimal, limited to transportation and autonomous mobility mentions.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
