   "OMB to issue guidance requiring Chief AI Officers and minimum risk-management practices for rights- or safety-impacting government AI.",
   "Sector actions on healthcare, transportation (DOT NETT Council, autonomous mobility), education, labor and civil rights.",
   "Directs a National Security Memorandum on military and intelligence AI and creates the White House AI Council."
